# AI + billing safety

- Every new `/api/generate-*` (or paid AI) route must call `gateAiGeneration`.
- Free = 15 gens/month, Pro = 500 soft cap — match `web/src/lib/billing/plans.ts`.
- Do not burn provider keys in agents: skip live generate calls unless acceptance needs them; check `/api/ai-status` first.
- Category thumbs are stock under `web/public/thumbs/` — never auto-generate with Gemini on capture.
- Draft prompts must not ask for tomas / camera beats; return `beats: []`.
